@startuml
' UML Component 03a — Domain-event reactions
' Evidence status: Implemented source modules and versioned event contracts.
' Updated: 2026-07-29.

!pragma layout elk
left to right direction

skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam PageMargin 10
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam componentStyle uml2
skinparam defaultFontName SansSerif
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
skinparam ArrowColor #475569
skinparam component {
  BackgroundColor #F0FDF4
  BorderColor #16A34A
  FontColor #14532D
}

component "Publishing Command" as Publisher
component "Versioned event seam\nin-process / durable outbox" as Events #FEF3C7
component "Listener\ninbound adapter" as Listener #DBEAFE
component "Local consumer\nCommand / Query" as Consumer #FCE7F3
component "Outbound adapters\nnotification · Audit · search · cache" as Adapters

Publisher -right-> Events : publish/stage
Events -right-> Listener : deliver
Listener -down-> Consumer : one event intent
Consumer -right-> Adapters : consumer-owned ports

note right of Consumer : Listener delegates one event intent to one local Command or Query

@enduml
